  </div>
</div>

</div>

    </div>
          <div class="views-row">
           
<div class="node--embedded">
    <h3>
        <a href="/code/16/70/310" rel="bookmark"><span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden">16.70.310  Persons Riding Bicycles Must Obey Traffic Regulations.</span>
</a>
    </h3>
    



<div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--label-hidden field--name-field-section-body field--type-text-long ck-content"><div class="field__item"><ol class="code-list"><li>Every person riding a bicycle upon a roadway is subject to state law and the provisions of this Title applicable to the driver of a vehicle, except state law and those provisions of this Title that by their very nature can have no application.</li></ol></div></div><div class="views-element-container">
<div class="mb-6 view view-eva view-city-code-list view-id-city_code_list view-display-id-eva_embedded_code_chapters js-view-dom-id-ead910e6b4814a31e63f245e7fc70e8950e2b3e6705d8e8a9829ae9531d11d38">
  
    

  
  

  
  
  

  
  

  
  </div>
</div>
<div class="views-element-container">
<div class="mb-6 view view-eva view-city-code-list view-id-city_code_list view-display-id-eva_embedded_code_sections js-view-dom-id-d3983f9d962f3f0e6e074ef66179b79012d5e80eb432a2b840c0a8643aabd557">
  
    

  
  

  
  
  

  
  

  
