          <div class="views-row">
           
<div class="node--embedded">
    <h3>
        <a href="/code/16/90/001" rel="bookmark"><span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden">16.90.001 Generally.</span>
</a>
    </h3>
    



<div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--label-hidden field--name-field-section-body field--type-text-long ck-content"><div class="field__item"><ol class="code-list"><li>The following words and phrases when used in this Title, for the purpose of this Title, have the meanings respectively ascribed to them in this Chapter, except in those instances where the context clearly indicates a different meaning. Definitions of words and phrases in the Oregon Revised Statutes may be applied unless defined differently in this Title or in those instances where the context clearly indicates a different meaning.</li></ol></div></div><div class="views-element-container">
<div class="mb-6 view view-eva view-city-code-list view-id-city_code_list view-display-id-eva_embedded_code_chapters js-view-dom-id-39d18d1cc09f6d6f6a08c0ed3d08a0352562b20797d3bfc5c64fb7ab1b4113bd">
  
    

  
  

  
  
  

  
  

  
