<div class="node--embedded">
    <h3>
        <a href="/code/16/90/005" rel="bookmark"><span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden">16.90.005 Abandoned Vehicle.</span>
</a>
    </h3>
    



<div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--label-hidden field--name-field-section-body field--type-text-long ck-content"><div class="field__item"><ol class="code-list"><li>A vehicle that remains in violation for more than 24 hours and one or more of the following conditions exist:</li><li><strong>A.&nbsp;</strong> The vehicle does not have a lawfully affixed, unexpired registration plate, or fails to display current registration.</li><li><strong>B.</strong>&nbsp; The vehicle appears to be inoperative or disabled.</li><li><strong>C.&nbsp;</strong> The vehicle appears to be wrecked, partially dismantled or junked.</li></ol></div></div><div class="views-element-container">
