    </h3>
    



<div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--label-hidden field--name-field-section-body field--type-text-long ck-content"><div class="field__item"><ol class="code-list"><li>A type of vehicle that:</li><li><strong>A.&nbsp; </strong>Is designed to be operated on the ground on wheels;</li><li><strong>B.&nbsp; </strong>Has a seat or saddle for use of the rider;</li><li><strong>C.&nbsp; </strong>Is designed to travel with not more than three wheels in contact with the ground;</li><li><strong>D.&nbsp; </strong>Is propelled exclusively by human power; and</li><li><strong>E.&nbsp;</strong> Has every wheel more than 14 inches in diameter or two tandem wheels either of which is more than 14 inches in diameter.</li></ol></div></div><div class="views-element-container">
