        <a href="/code/16/90/405" rel="bookmark"><span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden">16.90.405 Truck.</span>
</a>
    </h3>
    



<div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--label-hidden field--name-field-section-body field--type-text-long ck-content"><div class="field__item"><ol class="code-list"><li>Every motor vehicle designed, used or maintained primarily for the transportation of property, goods or providing a service, tow truck with passenger plates, step vans, vehicle length or width or height greater than original manufacturer's vehicle dimensions, and meeting the description as defined by DMV registration as a truck, van or pickup.</li></ol></div></div><div class="views-element-container">
<div class="mb-6 view view-eva view-city-code-list view-id-city_code_list view-display-id-eva_embedded_code_chapters js-view-dom-id-9ccbf5444682f0af0ae301007f6eb1f11e010ce2e30031096922f3455c9104da">
  
    

  
  

  
  
  

  
  

  
  </div>
