    </h3>
    



<div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--label-hidden field--name-field-section-body field--type-text-long ck-content"><div class="field__item"><ol class="code-list"><li>Any person who conducts business in the public right-of-way or any other public property.</li></ol></div></div><div class="views-element-container">
