    </h3>
    



<div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--label-hidden field--name-field-section-body field--type-text-long ck-content"><div class="field__item"><ol class="code-list"><li>A facility for the movement of pedestrians, vehicles or goods, the specific user or users being determined by modifying words, such as road, bicycle, pedestrian, etc. Path and lane are synonyms for way, and likewise may be given a more specific meaning through use of a specified user or specific definition. See: roadway, pedestrian way, traffic lane, bicycle path, et. al.</li></ol></div></div><div class="views-element-container">
